        "title": "Questions, answered.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "question": "Is TUTU free?",
            "answer": "<p>The TestFlight beta is free to join. At launch, TUTU will be free to download, with a Premium upgrade (monthly, annual, or lifetime) that unlocks all features.</p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "How does the erasing work?",
            "answer": "<p>Tap an object and TUTU finds its outline automatically, then an on-device image-inpainting model rebuilds the background where the object used to be. Everything runs locally on your iPhone.</p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "What can it remove?",
            "answer": "<p>People, pets, trash cans, power lines, signs, blemishes—anything you can tap or paint over. Areas with plenty of surrounding texture rebuild most naturally.</p>"
          },
          {
